{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-002", "category": "ordinary_tutorial", "context_hash": "a655fb123c0f4bf33a28144790347b3b9d2670bb98479d0562aba83ef177fbf4", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi|and what Gmsh is not so good at|paragraph|3587489ab996a1a52601d4c7ed0358ad8b20c5e27ef2274f73645bde8164877c", "msgid": "While Gmsh can create and manipulate geometries interactively, it is in\nno way a full-fledged replacement for an advanced CAD system.", "msgid_sha256": "3587489ab996a1a52601d4c7ed0358ad8b20c5e27ef2274f73645bde8164877c", "node": "and what Gmsh is not so good at", "protected_hash": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "protected_values": [], "reference_translation": "虽然 Gmsh 可以交互式地创建和操作几何体，但它绝不是高级 CAD 系统的功能完备替代品。", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "00cd43cb56c598f7f8c594b68e813f0eeeab77cfe42985c019c2e427032cd702", "semantic_key": "3587489ab996a1a52601d4c7ed0358ad8b20c5e27ef2274f73645bde8164877c", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi", "source_hash": "2920c082129a349b092c54aa92c4694f70277fe1b3a8a164a5544e26cc2ac933", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi::and what Gmsh is not so good at", "subcategory": "prose", "unit_id": "8ad6aa5f8d20f2bd18df6aee394f22245f310881fe2286499b98079eabe2ae48"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-018", "category": "ordinary_tutorial", "context_hash": "3f6df18fc64d238be25923603dea98b61ea4259d6ebe11e048eb8c7f02738e3d", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi|Gmsh tutorial|paragraph|452dc216bc4204ccb388395d747853e4e74ea2a33ae84bcd200c44ee0820cbe9", "msgid": "All the tutorials starting with the letter @file{t} are available both\nusing the scripting language and the API. Extended tutorials, starting\nwith the letter @file{x}, introduce features that are only available\nthrough the API.", "msgid_sha256": "452dc216bc4204ccb388395d747853e4e74ea2a33ae84bcd200c44ee0820cbe9", "node": "Gmsh tutorial", "protected_hash": "750229111400f568df6282bb78d4097899a307db813c003fa0875163531e138f", "protected_values": ["@file{t}", "@file{x}"], "reference_translation": "所有以字母 @file{t} 开头的教程都可以使用脚本语言和 API。以字母 @file{x} 开头的扩展教程介绍只能通过 API 使用的功能。", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "1f54aa6543678a2a2969e40a8e6e83074a9e9723ea4b45a23a60222db2358142", "semantic_key": "452dc216bc4204ccb388395d747853e4e74ea2a33ae84bcd200c44ee0820cbe9", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi", "source_hash": "6ddc4f6a84898fab05cf6fb0643cb34363b7bd704735186a03e211d673d12537", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi::Gmsh tutorial", "subcategory": "tutorial", "unit_id": "1d7ea6a124ccd52e6870ff2f3f7f13713a4326531832ae1e8d6ec04ee9b10d80"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-031", "category": "script_api", "context_hash": "fc3e07cc512128cbf89af410a2b7b50a0c0df3e8509afa1186117356ace6d675", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi|Volumes|paragraph|Torus ( @var{expression} ) = @{ @var{expression-list} @};", "msgid": "Create a torus, defined by the 3 coordinates of its center and 2 radii.\nAn additional expression defines the angular opening. @code{Torus} is\nonly available with the OpenCASCADE kernel.", "msgid_sha256": "0b20566dacba0b47d8e905076acb610f316c6312b4d169ada5c67dab72442759", "node": "Volumes", "protected_hash": "6624cf426cff584189ed7f279712356a699bfea58b05e48cc4134b135b8566f1", "protected_values": ["3", "2", "@code{Torus}"], "reference_translation": "创建一个圆环体，由其中心的 3 个坐标和 2 个半径定义。\n附加表达式定义开口角。@code{Torus} 仅适用于 OpenCASCADE 内核。", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "00aaab5192aa7f3c466e6f0992f7f338e6ce3ff5401ffa0348901f208e634dd0", "semantic_key": "Torus ( @var{expression} ) = @{ @var{expression-list} @};", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi", "source_hash": "0f87ac196b7cdbeb3d4ddfa49303c4e897fcf2a0430dca398b3b55ed9ea601ca", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi::Volumes", "subcategory": "scripting", "unit_id": "3811b7fe45c35fb1e3aeaa894dbcdc3424c935bb8eb363c913f0d9e6cdbe5a7b"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-043", "category": "script_api", "context_hash": "d1872f17af4cc1e09e8038b1737e11c67c7307676423a151ae10e4e83494984c", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/api.texi|Namespace gmsh/fltk|paragraph|gmsh/fltk/finalize", "msgid": "Close the FLTK graphical user interface. Can only be called in the main thread.", "msgid_sha256": "f4e83bd3078f6385ba7dc9adc48ec7d9807c6e5199d45e63375e3bacd55bf354", "node": "Namespace gmsh/fltk", "protected_hash": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "protected_values": [], "reference_translation": "关闭 FLTK 图形用户界面。只能在主线程中调用。", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "0013a0152210edb23a5c3d723a844b4f75011c47db5020de3e68c40e69bd231d", "semantic_key": "gmsh/fltk/finalize", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/api.texi", "source_hash": "98304a32e106842d3c35f28588aba85862bcdfe4baf2388355408e179d370d66", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/api.texi::Namespace gmsh/fltk", "subcategory": "api", "unit_id": "bf1aec61de7057e94d750b94a12acde25b32860588e59c5b625f03db6b9b5792"}
{"benchmark_id": "bmk-v1-081", "category": "formats_compile_faq", "context_hash": "81475759e8cabe27dc491d9c52509b23b4e3f13b597f0b1e29192954accb120a", "msgctxt": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi|MSH file format version 2 (Legacy)|paragraph|@var{node-number-list}", "msgid": "is the list of the node numbers of the @var{n}-th element. The ordering of\nthe nodes is given in @ref{Node ordering}.", "msgid_sha256": "dc192fa4fcbfb434de1068f007f55b1e820adb8a7999209090546d408c1ecf4d", "node": "MSH file format version 2 (Legacy)", "protected_hash": "143aa104565e2eda8346b99a12473258efdd4bbf2aa6d1d78ff09b9c97167bd8", "protected_values": ["@var{n}", "@ref{Node ordering}"], "reference_translation": "是第 @var{n} 个单元的节点编号列表。节点的顺序见 @ref{Node ordering}。", "reference_translation_status": "accepted", "role": "paragraph", "schema_version": 1, "selection_method": "sha256-stratified-v1", "selection_rank": "040c972ba513de3249da985169b4b412f1f1ef3b0aa31d8f5a2c266f4003101d", "semantic_key": "@var{node-number-list}", "source_file": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi", "source_hash": "f7f289bb70c290d5de712845ec205e73eedf2b3d8f69d3991b2b59a3c7f2ed55", "structure_path": "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi::MSH file format version 2 (Legacy)", "subcategory": "formats", "unit_id": "6a452510f40f48048a28a8b9537580bda91cd3603556802edcbf09337a508ec5"}
